@* While a long job runs (Content Studio writing an article, revising a draft): the Overwatch boot
   screen over the page, with what's happening and how long it has taken. The same screen as
   LoadingIndicator (05-11-26: these two pages had a white Bootstrap-spinner panel of their own,
   styled twice inline). The bar loops, since the job's length isn't known. *@

<div class="gws-busy-overlay" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true">
    <div class="gws-boot gws-boot-panel gws-busy-panel">
        <div class="gws-boot-line" aria-hidden="true">PROCESSING REQUEST...</div>
        <div class="gws-boot-bar" aria-hidden="true"><div class="gws-boot-bar-fill"></div></div>
        <div class="gws-busy-title">@Title</div>
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Message))
        {
            <div class="gws-busy-detail">@Message</div>
        }
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Elapsed))
        {
            <div class="gws-busy-detail gws-busy-elapsed">@Elapsed</div>
        }
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Title { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    [Parameter] public string? Message { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string? Elapsed { get; set; }
}
